   "widgets_values": [
    "Medium close-up, she is placed right of centre, empty dark space to the left of clxudia, a woman in her mid-twenties with a glossy black blunt jaw-length bob, heavy straight bangs, one thin clay-orange streak through the bangs, a small flat clay-orange eight-pointed star hair clip and a thin headset microphone at her cheek, wearing an oversized boxy paper-white poplin shirt with big puffed sleeves, cropped at the waist, a thin black leather harness belt and a small blank white garment tag hanging from it on a string. She looks straight into the lens with a calm, open, warm expression, about to sing, lips gently closed, her head upright and level, chin level, shoulders square to the camera, her mouth clear of the microphone. Soft top light, black void, the top edges of two terracotta tablets at the bottom of frame. Fashion editorial film still, shot on 35mm colour film, fine grain. The clay-orange streak and star clip are the only warm colour on her. No text, no letters, no logos."
   ],
